  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Global Infrastructure Programme will adapt and disseminate world-leading UK infrastructure methodologies, in order to produce sustainable and lasting change in partner countries.

The programme operates in 3 Prosperity Fund priority countries: Colombia, Indonesia and Vietnam.</narrative>
